                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A fine example of the terrible bileware currently plaguing Steam, Dragon Lords 3D has the temerity to call itself a strategy game. The strategy part involves dropping units onto a map and watching them auto fight, like we’re playing a fucking lane game.\n\nDL3DS looks like a game from the late 90s (and a knockoff Heroes of Paragon, which also looks like shit!) and features all the tell-tale mobile signs, like gems, dragging the mouse pointer, clicking for resources and lengthy time locks. I assume you can buy gems for real money to speed everything up and make the game easier for yourself, but why would you want to.",
